# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values. .env itself is
# gitignored -- never commit real keys.
#
# OPENAI_KEY is the primary key as of 2026-07-24: powers
# llm_sector_matcher.py's default classification provider,
# cross_reference.py's LLM-based entity matching (brand variants,
# parent/subsidiary judgments), and ercot_large_load_tracker.py's vision
# fallback -- all on gpt-5.4-mini, confirmed live for both text and
# vision. DEEPSEEK_API_KEY / GEMINI_API_KEY / ANTHROPIC_API_KEY are kept
# as optional alternate providers (--provider deepseek / anthropic for
# llm_sector_matcher.py), not required for the default path anymore.
#
# TAVILY_API_KEY grounds the LLM entity-matching judgments in a real live
# search rather than model memory -- confirmed necessary, not optional:
# asked directly, models couldn't reliably answer real ownership
# questions from memory alone.
#
# OCTEN_API_KEY replaces STEEL_API_KEY for check_air_permits' real page
# fetch (octen_client.py) -- requires a payment method on the Octen
# account (octen.ai/platform/billing) before real calls succeed, even
# with a valid key; confirmed via a real 403 "Payment method required"
# response, not a code bug. STEEL_API_KEY kept as the prior working
# implementation until Octen billing is set up.

OPENAI_KEY=
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
TAVILY_API_KEY=
STEEL_API_KEY=
OCTEN_API_KEY=
